### Create a new task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete project documentation",
  "description": "Write comprehensive documentation for the API endpoints",
  "completed": false,
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59"
}

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Get a specific task (replace {id} with actual task ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

### Update a task (replace {id} with actual task ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated task title",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "dueDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59"
}

### Delete a specific task (replace {id} with actual task ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

### Delete all tasks
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Get completed tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/filter/completed?completed=true

### Get incomplete tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/filter/completed?completed=false

### Get HIGH priority tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/filter/priority?priority=HIGH

### Get MEDIUM priority tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/filter/priority?priority=MEDIUM

### Get LOW priority tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/filter/priority?priority=LOW
